      "message": "goto free_ppages? So that if we abort in the middle of nr_pages we do free what\u0027s has been allocated within this function? \n\nAnd actually I wonder if it wouldn\u0027t be clearer to share the return path?\n\n```\nret \u003d __pkvm_pin_user_pages()\nswitch (ret) {\ncase -EHWPOISON;\n    return 0;\ncase 0:\n    ret \u003d __pkmv_pages_to_ppages()\n    if (ret)\n        unpin_user_pages()\n     break;\ncase -EREMOTEIO:\n    ret \u003d __pkvm_mem_abort_dmabuf();\n    break;\n}\n\nif (ret || list_empty(\u0026ppages))\n    goto free_ppages; \n```\n\nWDYS?",
